"216171":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#281a78","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx216171-IhhbG5GAio2C.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx216171-IhhbG5GAio2C.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx216171-IhhbG5GAio2C.png"},"description":"After entering college, Azusa Shirakawa was enjoying campus life, marking a fresh start from her high school days, when she had devoted herself entirely to judo. But a casual joke from her childhood friend, Sae, ignited a fire within her. <i>“Having a friends-with-benefits relationship isn't so bad, you know?”</i> She had brushed off those words as a joke, but—her “one-time fling” with Takuma, her serious and sincere childhood friend, awakened a desire within Azusa, and her body found itself unable to resist the pleasure. Contrary to her intentions, she found herself losing control time and time again. <i>“I never thought the day would come when I'd be getting my body in shape not for judo competitions, but for sex...”</i> She, who was supposed to be so strong-willed, finds herself “losing” to a man. He—serious yet lecherous—begins to “corrupt” her.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Pinkpineapple, translated)","duration":30,"favourites":12,"format":"OVA","genres":["Hentai"],"id":216171,"idMal":64899,"isAdult":true,"isLicensed":true,"popularity":263,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2026,"source":"OTHER","startDate":{"day":27,"month":11,"year":2026},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","studios":[{"id":6852,"name":"Studio 1st"}],"synonyms":["Loosen Up"],"title":{"native":"真面目なキミにハマるカラダ THE ANIMATION","romaji":"Majime na Kimi ni Hamaru Karada THE ANIMATION"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793160198},
