"216926":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/216926-JKxPNnGV89bf.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1c9bb","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx216926-FDFaH12RueCw.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx216926-FDFaH12RueCw.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx216926-FDFaH12RueCw.png"},"description":"Kazu reunites with his childhood friend, Shion, for the first time in a long while. He falls for her all over again as he realizes she’s become even more beautiful, but despite this long-awaited reunion, she seems somehow distant… Shion is harboring a secret Kazu knows nothing about. Though Shion also harbors secret feelings for Kazu, her father, with practiced ease, runs his hands over her sensitive spots and forces her to be “friendly” with him once again today…!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Getchu, translated)","duration":16,"favourites":5,"format":"OVA","genres":["Hentai"],"id":216926,"idMal":65038,"isAdult":true,"isLicensed":true,"popularity":208,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2026,"source":"OTHER","startDate":{"day":27,"month":11,"year":2026},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","studios":[{"id":405,"name":"T-REX"}],"title":{"native":"お隣の贄","romaji":"Otonari no Nie"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793160198},
"216939":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c943","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx216939-Sk1H8XjYNID2.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx216939-Sk1H8XjYNID2.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx216939-Sk1H8XjYNID2.png"},"description":"Modern life means modern solutions—even to supernatural problems. So of course the government would have a classification system, special schools, and licenses for people with mysterious powers. Any manifestation of a miracle is enough to be called a Himiko, but only those with full certification may use the title of god. And high schooler Nagi is in serious need of a god! The death of her grandmother has left her family shrine devoid of the necessary divinity, and her hopelessly shut-in Himiko brother isn't looking promising. But if Nagi isn't careful, her search for a god might end with her finding more than she bargained for...\n<br><br>\n(Source: Yen Press)","favourites":8,"format":"TV","genres":["Fantasy","Romance"],"hashtag":"#神さま学校の落ちこぼれ #神さま学校","id":216939,"idMal":65015,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"popularity":1383,"source":"MANGA","status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","synonyms":["The Failure at God School"],"tags":[{"id":66,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Super Power","rank":20},{"id":53,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Shoujo","rank":20},{"id":253,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Gods","rank":20},{"id":1899,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Brainwashing","rank":20},{"id":494,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Twins","rank":20},{"id":282,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Hikikomori","rank":20},{"id":586,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Cult","rank":20},{"id":321,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":20},{"id":46,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"School","rank":20},{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":20}],"title":{"native":"神さま学校の落ちこぼれ","romaji":"Kami-sama Gakko